# assets/js/roster.js is NOT ignored, deliberately.
#
# It holds 3,703 real names and email addresses and was kept out of the repo
# for that reason. That turned out to be worse: the deploy builds from this
# repo, so every published site served synthetic demo names instead of the
# real roster, and nothing said so. It is tracked now.
#
# Regenerate it with tools/extract-roster.py when the roster changes.
# KEEP THIS REPOSITORY PRIVATE.
